// Dapple's calibrated beech bark (smooth, grey, faint lenticels and
// scars). Each tree bakes it at these heights on its trunk, at its own girth
// there, and renderers blend the stages up the stem; the girth and height
// below give the species' own set for card bakes.
(module: "beech", girth: 2.5, height: 1.3, size: 1024, stages: [0.5, 3.0, 8.0])
